iffany Walk Residence, Sanctuary Lakes",1.5023474178403755,"data:image/jpeg;base64,","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/0f4d866c6525e1fa5b15d1d3a7991c3c8c6711d6-1600x1065.jpg","Ensuite with twin vessel basins on a marble benchtop and gold tapware, Tiffany Walk Residence, Melbourne","data:image/jpeg;base64,","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/5dca9ca45f41f1059c34e43ea700ca945a2d0e51-1600x1066.jpg","Master bedroom with floor-to-ceiling glazing framing golf-course views, Tiffany Walk Residence, Sanctuary Lakes","data:image/jpeg;base64,","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/67b8c5adcd7f9194f7978dca7bea485035b16593-1600x1066.jpg","client","Private Residence","duration","12 months","size","560 sqm",{"_252":424,"_254":255,"_256":425,"_262":426,"_264":427},{"_252":418,"_254":255,"_256":419,"_262":420,"_264":265},{"_252":412,"_254":255,"_256":413,"_262":414,"_264":265},{"_252":406,"_254":255,"_256":407,"_262":408,"_264":366},{"_252":400,"_254":255,"_256":401,"_262":402,"_264":265},{"_252":394,"_254":255,"_256":395,"_262":396,"_264":265},{"_252":388,"_254":255,"_256":389,"_262":390,"_264":366},{"_252":382,"_254":255,"_256":383,"_262":384,"_264":265},{"_252":376,"_254":255,"_256":377,"_262":378,"_264":265},{"_252":370,"_254":255,"_256":371,"_262":372,"_264":265},{"_252":363,"_254":255,"_256":364,"_262":365,"_264":366},{"_252":357,"_254":255,"_256":358,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":359,"_264":265},{"_252":351,"_254":255,"_256":352,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":353,"_264":265},{"_252":345,"_254":255,"_256":346,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":347,"_264":265},{"_252":339,"_254":255,"_256":340,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":341,"_264":265},{"_252":333,"_254":255,"_256":334,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":335,"_264":265},{"_252":327,"_254":255,"_256":328,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":329,"_264":265},{"_252":321,"_254":255,"_256":322,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":323,"_264":265},{"_252":315,"_254":255,"_256":316,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":317,"_264":265},{"_252":309,"_254":255,"_256":310,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":311,"_264":265},{"_252":303,"_254":255,"_256":304,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":305,"_264":265},{"_252":297,"_254":255,"_256":298,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":299,"_264":265},{"_252":291,"_254":255,"_256":292,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":293,"_264":265},{"_252":285,"_254":255,"_256":286,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":287,"_264":265},{"_252":279,"_254":255,"_256":280,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":281,"_264":265},{"_252":273,"_254":255,"_256":274,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":275,"_264":265},{"_252":253,"_254":255,"_256":257,"_258":259,"_260":261,"_262":263,"_264":265},"_key","249fa7fca2c7","_type","block","children",[266],"level",1,"listItem","bullet","markDefs",[],"style","normal",{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":270,"_271":272},"cd808d0de756","span","marks",[],"text","Luxury landscaping and architectural façade","e9fe700dc304",[276],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":277,"_271":278},[],"Energy-efficient construction","1d830c37c487",[282],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":283,"_271":284},[],"Multiple indoor and outdoor entertaining areas","3a9fa4e6b67a",[288],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":289,"_271":290},[],"Engineered timber flooring","9e79372099b2",[294],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":295,"_271":296},[],"Custom-designed joinery throughout","3a9fa2e060d4",[300],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":301,"_271":302},[],"Designer kitchen with premium appliances and butler’s pantry","fdaddf99d9a1",[306],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":307,"_271":308},[],"Feature fireplace with full-height marble surround","9e629aeafb66",[312],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":313,"_271":314},[],"Premium marble and natural stone throughout","e5cf8968932b",[318],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":319,"_271":320},[],"Floor-to-ceiling architectural glazing","c97a58816d63",[324],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":325,"_271":326},[],"3-metre ceilings throughout","d57d39bde4f5",[330],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":331,"_271":332},[],"Grand double-height entrance with feature void","12834a1e2883",[336],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":337,"_271":338},[],"Dedicated home theatre","ef6b92bd34cc",[342],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":343,"_271":344},[],"Architectural spiral staircase","23a12f193411",[348],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":349,"_271":350},[],"Resort-style swimming pool and integrated spa","de574eb36a64",[354],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":355,"_271":356},[],"Prestigious golf course frontage","6bc0db9aab57",[360],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":361,"_271":362},[],"Approximately 560sqm (60 Squares) custom residence","e311ce228169",[367],[],"h3",{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":368,"_271":369},[],"Key Features","2839ad7792ad",[373],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":374,"_271":375},[],"By managing every stage of the project—from design coordination and approvals through to construction and final handover—we delivered a residence that exceeds expectations in both quality and design.","6ca1b477e11e",[379],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":380,"_271":381},[],"The home features a dramatic double-height entrance, a custom spiral staircase, premium natural stone finishes, bespoke joinery and expansive floor-to-ceiling glazing that frames the surrounding golf course. A resort-style swimming pool and spa create a seamless connection between the indoor living spaces and the outdoor entertaining area, while every material and finish was carefully selected to deliver a timeless, luxurious home.","21f58fd85f3c",[385],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":386,"_271":387},[],"Working closely with the client from concept through to completion, Siari Build delivered a bespoke residence that combines sophisticated architectural design with superior craftsmanship.","c1bf7876449a",[391],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":392,"_271":393},[],"Our Solution","0e9fe8d1d23f",[397],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":398,"_271":399},[],"Executing these design ambitions demanded meticulous planning, precision construction and exceptional attention to detail across every stage of the project.","8e1a3fec833b",[403],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":404,"_271":405},[],"The vision was to create a statement residence that maximised its premium golf course location while delivering uncompromising luxury and everyday practicality. The design required expansive open-plan living, abundant natural light, seamless indoor-outdoor integration and premium architectural detailing throughout, while maintaining privacy, energy efficiency and timeless appeal.","377ee23dc1ca",[409],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":410,"_271":411},[],"The Challenge","a581b14364f3",[415],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":416,"_271":417},[],"Positioned within the prestigious Sanctuary Lakes estate overlooking the golf course, the home seamlessly integrates indoor and outdoor living through floor-to-ceiling glazing, a resort-style swimming pool and spa, and generous entertaining spaces. Every aspect of the residence has been meticulously designed to create a home that is both luxurious and functional.","af2624f57fe4",[421],[],{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":422,"_271":423},[],"The Tiffany Walk Residence is a luxury custom home designed to deliver timeless architecture, exceptional craftsmanship and resort-style family living. Spanning approximately 560sqm (60 Squares), this residence showcases premium finishes, expansive living spaces and carefully considered architectural details throughout.","6d3fc6ef7496",[428],[],"h2",{"_252":267,"_254":268,"_269":429,"_271":430},[],"Overview",{"_432":433,"_434":435,"_436":437},"settings",{"_496":497,"_498":499,"_500":501,"_502":503,"_504":114,"_505":506,"_507":-5,"_508":509,"_510":459,"_511":-5,"_512":-5,"_513":459,"_514":515,"_516":517,"_518":519,"_520":521,"_522":-5,"_523":524,"_525":526,"_141":527,"_528":529,"_530":531},"navigation",{"_456":457,"_458":459,"_460":461,"_462":463},"services",[438,439,440,441,442,443],{"_271":454,"_30":455},{"_271":452,"_30":453},{"_271":450,"_30":451},{"_271":448,"_30":449},{"_271":446,"_30":447},{"_271":444,"_30":445},"Extra space for family, guests or rental income - designed and built properly, not bolted on.","Granny Flats","From a single kitchen to a whole-home transformation - old bones, new life.","Renovations","More room without the move. Ground-floor and second-storey extensions that look like they were always there.","Extensions & Additions","Dual occupancies and townhouses that get the most out of your site — and your return.","Multi-Dwelling Developments","Already have plans or an architect? We build to your design with the rigour it deserves.","Bespoke Builds","Architecturally led homes built around how you actually live — not a catalogue floor plan.","Custom Homes","footerMenu",[485,486,487,488,489,490],"headerCtaEnabled",true,"headerMenu",[470,471,472,473],"socialMenu",[464],{"_465":-5,"_466":-5,"_467":468,"_168":469},"hideFromMenu","icon","label","Instagram","https://www.instagram.com/siari_build/",{"_467":-5,"_475":483,"_477":484},{"_467":-5,"_475":481,"_477":482},{"_467":-5,"_475":479,"_477":480},{"_467":474,"_475":476,"_477":478},"Start Your Project","pageSlug","contact","pageTitle","Contact","projects","Projects","about","About","home","Home",{"_467":-5,"_475":483,"_477":484},{"_467":-5,"_475":481,"_477":482},{"_467":-5,"_475":479,"_477":480},{"_467":-5,"_475":476,"_477":478},{"_467":493,"_475":494,"_477":495},{"_467":-5,"_475":491,"_477":492},"privacy-policy","Privacy Policy","FAQ","faq","Frequently Asked Questions","address","Point Cook, Victoria","copyrightText","All rights reserved.","email","info@siaribuild.com.au","legalLine","ABN 20 688 039 894 | Builder License CDB-U 101713","maintenanceEnabled","maintenanceHeading","WE'RE ON THE TOOLS.","maintenanceImage","maintenanceMessage","The site's getting a quick upgrade and will be back shortly. In the meantime, if you'd like to start a project, reach us using the options below.","maintenanceShowContact","mapAddressLabel","mapAreaRadius","mapHidePin","mapLocation",{"_254":532,"_161":533,"_534":535,"_536":537},"mapZoom",12,"notFoundButtonLabel","Back to Home","notFoundHeading","THIS ONE'S OFF THE PLANS.","notFoundImage","notFoundMessage","The page you're after isn't here — moved, renamed, or never built. Let's get you back to solid ground.","phone","0419 000 991","Siari Build","tagline","Designed to Impress. Built to Last.","workingHours","Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\nSaturday: 9:00 AM - 2:00 PM\nSunday: Closed","geopoint",7,"lat",-37.895696,"lng",144.76186]
